Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1160
Set Height 380
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Hide
Type "export AITEXT_SOUNDS=off PATH=$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH PS1='> '; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "echo 'we was going to teh store and buyed stuff' | aitext grammar"
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "echo 'mtg thu 3pm - bring q3 numbers - ana remote' | aitext expand"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "echo 'Be there in ten minutes.' | AITEXT_INSTRUCTION='pirate speak' aitext ask"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Sleep 1.5s
